---
title: DocuMind AI - successful question workflow (configured mock provider)
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant B as Browser / ask.js
    participant V as Django / api_ask
    participant Q as Usage service
    participant D as SQLite / ORM storage
    participant R as Retrieval service
    participant P as MockProvider

    Note over U,P: Preconditions: signed-in session, valid CSRF token, owned READY document, remaining quota, relevant chunks
    U->>B: Select document, enter question, submit
    activate B
    B->>B: Trim input, capture selected filename, show loading
    B->>V: POST /api/ask/ - JSON {document_id, question}<br/>Session cookie + X-CSRFToken
    activate V
    Note over B,V: Django middleware handles session, CSRF and lazy request.user, require_POST allows POST
    V->>D: Resolve session-backed user on authentication check
    activate D
    D-->>V: Authenticated user
    deactivate D
    V->>V: _require_auth_json passes, parse body<br/>Trim question, validate presence and length
    V->>D: Document.objects.get(pk=document_id, owner=request.user)
    activate D
    D-->>V: Owned Document
    deactivate D
    V->>V: Confirm document.status == READY

    rect rgb(237, 247, 251)
    V->>Q: try_consume(request.user)
    activate Q
    Q->>D: atomic(): get_or_create(user, date=localdate())<br/>UsageRecord, create count=0 if absent
    activate D
    D-->>Q: Today's usage record
    deactivate D
    Q->>Q: Check count below DAILY_QUESTION_LIMIT (10)
    Q->>D: UPDATE count = F(count) + 1, COMMIT
    activate D
    D-->>Q: Usage increment persisted
    deactivate D
    Q-->>V: True - accepted and consumed
    deactivate Q
    Note over Q,D: Quota is recorded BEFORE retrieval/provider work.<br/>select_for_update is requested by code, SQLite has no row-level FOR UPDATE.
    end

    V->>R: retrieve(document.chunks.all(), question)
    activate R
    R->>D: list(chunks) evaluates lazy queryset<br/>SELECT chunks for authorized document
    activate D
    D-->>R: DocumentChunk rows (document_id, seq order)
    deactivate D
    R->>R: Fit TF-IDF on chunk text, transform question<br/>Cosine similarity, descending rank<br/>Top 3 candidates, keep score >= 0.05
    R-->>V: RetrievedChunk list with text, labels and scores
    deactivate R
    V->>V: get_provider() selects MockProvider<br/>Effective AI_PROVIDER = mock
    V->>P: generate(question, retrieved, document.original_filename)
    activate P
    P->>P: _build_sources(retrieved)<br/>Stitch labeled passages into extractive answer
    Note over P: Local mock execution, no external AI API call.<br/>This success path has non-empty retrieved context.
    P-->>V: ProviderAnswer(answer, sources, supported=true,<br/>provider=mock, is_mock=true)
    deactivate P

    V->>D: _save_request(): INSERT AIRequest<br/>user, document, document_name, question, answer,<br/>status=success, provider_mode=mock, sources,<br/>error_detail="", created_at auto-set
    activate D
    D-->>V: Saved AIRequest with id
    deactivate D
    V->>Q: get_usage_summary(request.user)
    activate Q
    Q->>D: SELECT today's UsageRecord (read only)
    activate D
    D-->>Q: Current count
    deactivate D
    Q-->>V: used, limit, remaining, percent, at_limit
    deactivate Q
    V-->>B: HTTP 200 application/json<br/>id, status, answer, supported, is_mock,<br/>provider, sources, usage
    deactivate V
    B->>B: showAnswer(): answer text + success badge<br/>Source labels, snippets, scores + selected filename<br/>Update remaining/limit, show mock notice, clear loading
    B-->>U: Display answer, sources and remaining allowance
    deactivate B

